    {
      "text": "my right hand hath spanned heavens, 1 Ne. 20:13 (Isa. 48:13). those who enter covenant will be found at right hand of God, Mosiah 5:9. the Lord grants unto them who believe place at his right hand, Mosiah 26:23. if men know the Lord, they shall have place at right hand, Mosiah 26:24. unto righteous will the Lord grant inheritance at right hand, Alma 5:58. converted Lamanites would not flee from sword nor turn aside to right hand or to left, Alma 24:23. let not thy left hand know what thy right hand doeth, 3 Ne. 13:3 (Matt. 6:3). thou shalt break forth on right hand and on left, 3 Ne. 22:3 (Isa. 54:3). Christ sits on right hand of the Father’s power, Moro. 9:26.",
